#: index.md:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
msgstr "InstUI, overalt"

#: index.md:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr "En løst token-model, omformet til stylesheets, framework-bindings, native-kode og payloads til designværktøjer."

#: index.md:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Kom godt i gang"

#: index.md:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "The package map"
msgstr "Pakkeoversigt"

#: index.md:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API-reference"

#: index.md:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "CSS-reference"

#: index.md:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "Én sandhedskilde"

#: index.md:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
msgstr "Hver pakke læser den samme resolved token-IR. Ændr en token opstrøms, og den flyder til CSS, SCSS, native-kode og Figma på samme måde."

#: index.md:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Brug den mindste pakke"

#: index.md:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install just @pantoken/css for a stylesheet, @pantoken/react for hooks and icons, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr "Installer kun @pantoken/css for et stylesheet, @pantoken/react for hooks og ikoner, eller et bundler-preset for Tailwind, Panda eller MUI."

#: index.md:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Generer til enhver platform"

#: index.md:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
msgstr "Kør `pantoken generate` for at generere Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress og mere. De samme tokens, i hvert økosystems idiom."

#: index.md:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "No upstream coupling"
msgstr "Ingen opstrømskobling"

#: index.md:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
msgstr "Tokens leveres som vendored statisk JSON, så `npm i` aldrig henter fra en GitHub-only-kilde. Publicerbar, semver'd, offline-venlig."
